---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <img
      src="/profile_pic.jpeg"
      alt="Muhammad Ali Raza Shaheen"
      class="w-40 h-40 rounded-full object-cover mb-8"
    />
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">About</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-4">
      <p>
        I'm Muhammad Ali Raza Shaheen, Head of the Computer Science Department
        and a faculty member in Management Science at Al-Qadir University
        Project Trust. I lead the department's thesis research module for
        final-semester students and recently steered our CS program through
        NCEAC accreditation.
      </p>
      <p>
        My path into academia wasn't a straight line. I spent five years in
        telecom field operations, then moved into project leadership at PAF
        Kamra, followed by a stint as an Area Sales Manager at Nestle
        Pakistan. That cross-sector experience -- engineering, operations,
        project management, sales -- now shapes how I teach and research: I
        care as much about how ideas get applied in the real world as I do
        about the theory behind them.
      </p>
      <p>
        I hold an MS in Signal Processing for Communications from King's
        College London, an MBA from LUMS, and a BSc in
        Electrical/Communications Engineering from Riphah International
        University.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is where I track what I'm reading, testing, and applying
        across computer science, data science, and management -- partly a
        public research log, partly a working notebook I don't want to lose.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
